  "faqWhatIsQ": "What is MixRun?",
  "faqWhatIsA": "A discovery game. You start with a handful of raw elements and combine them two at a time to create new things,  each one a small piece of Indian heritage, from monuments and festivals to food, art and the people who shaped it.",

  "faqStartQ": "What do I start with?",
  "faqStartA": "Four elements: Earth, Water, Fire and Air. Everything else in the game is built from them.",

  "faqHowCombineQ": "How do I combine items?",
  "faqHowCombineA": "Drag an item from the library onto the canvas, then drop it on top of another. If the pair makes something, the new item appears and is added to your collection. If it doesn't, the items simply stay put,  nothing is lost, so experiment freely.",

  "faqHowManyQ": "How many items are there?",
  "faqHowManyA": "{count} in total, spread across {levels} stops on the Journey.",
  "@faqHowManyA": {
    "placeholders": {
      "count": { "type": "int" },
      "levels": { "type": "int" }
    }
  },

  "faqPairQ": "Can a pair make more than one thing?",
  "faqPairA": "No. Each pair has a single result, so re-mixing two items you have already combined just makes the same thing again.",

  "faqCantMakeQ": "Why won't two items combine?",
  "faqCantMakeA": "Either that pair has no recipe, or the item it would make belongs to a Journey level you haven't unlocked yet. Keep exploring the level you're on and it will open up.",

  "faqBasicQ": "What are \"basic\" items?",
  "faqBasicA": "The classical building blocks,  the four starters plus raw forces like Heat, Life and Motion that come straight from them. You can filter the Encyclopedia down to just these.",

  "faqDepletedQ": "What does \"Depleted\" mean?",
  "faqDepletedA": "You have already found every combination that uses that item. It stays in your library, but it has nothing new left to give.",

  "faqFinalQ": "What does \"Final\" mean?",
  "faqFinalA": "That item is never used as an ingredient in any recipe. It sits at the end of a chain,  a destination rather than a stepping stone.",

  "faqJourneyQ": "What is the Journey?",
  "faqJourneyA": "The path through the game. It opens with the Base Level and continues through five themed stops: States & UTs, History & Sites, Culture & Cuisine, Dance & Local Art, and Heroes & Kings.",

  "faqUnlockQ": "How do I unlock the next level?",
  "faqUnlockA": "Discover {percent}% of the level you are on. The Journey map shows how far along each stop you are.",
  "@faqUnlockA": {
    "placeholders": {
      "percent": { "type": "int" }
    }
  },

  "faqHintsQ": "How do hints work?",
  "faqHintsA": "A hint points you toward an item you haven't found yet. You can unlock {daily} a day by watching a short video, and hold up to {active} unsolved hints at once,  each one clears when you discover the item it points to.",
  "@faqHintsA": {
    "placeholders": {
      "daily": { "type": "int" },
      "active": { "type": "int" }
    }
  },

  "faqSaveQ": "Is my progress saved?",
  "faqSaveA": "Yes,  automatically, on this device, after every discovery. Sign in from Settings to back it up to your account and carry it to another device.",

  "faqResetQ": "Can I start over?",
  "faqResetA": "Yes. Settings › Progress › Reset clears every discovery and returns you to the four starting elements. It cannot be undone.",

  "faqLearnMoreQ": "Can I read more about an item?",
  "faqLearnMoreA": "Open any item you've discovered and use Read More for an article about it, or Watch a Video to search for it on YouTube.",

  "faqOfflineQ": "Does it work offline?",
  "faqOfflineA": "Yes. The whole game is on your device,  only signing in, syncing to your account and videos need a connection.",

  "faqLanguageQ": "Can I change the language?",
  "faqLanguageA": "Not yet. MixRun is in English for now, with more languages planned."
